<header class="mb-8">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Campaign Management</h2>
<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Create, schedule, and track public awareness campaigns.</p>
</header>
<section class="mb-8">
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Active Campaigns</h3>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-primary/20 dark:border-primary/30">
<table class="w-full text-left">
<thead class="bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark">
<tr>
<th class="p-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Campaign Name</th>
<th class="p-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Status</th>
<th class="p-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Start Date</th>
<th class="p-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">End Date</th>
<th class="p-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Reach</th>
<th class="p-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Engagement</th>
</tr>
</thead>
